Suggests: python3-pandas, python3-networkx
Description: Python bindings for the Holder core library
 Embed Holder projects, cards and connections directly in Python applications.
 Includes typed detached records and optional pandas and NetworkX adapters.
 Uses the system libholder shared library, with no running daemon required.
